=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Steel\" title=\"Steel\">Steel</a>:</b> <b>Steel</b> is the common metal used to make weapons and armor.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0008001500</span>8,001<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;5<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">4 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a></b>, Turn in 15&#32;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" title=\"Item:Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendations: Purple Dragon Knights</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation:_Purple_Dragon_Knights\" title=\"Item:Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights\">Commendation: Purple Dragon Knights</a>:</b> This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader. This is a token of favor earned by helping the Purple Dragon Knights. You can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+6 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +6 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Parrying\" title=\"Parrying\">Parrying VIII</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Parrying\" title=\"Parrying\">Parrying VIII</a>:</b> Passive: +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortitude_save\" title=\"Fortitude save\">Fortitude</a>, <a href=\"/page/Reflex_save\" title=\"Reflex save\">Reflex</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Will_save\" title=\"Will save\">Will</a> <a href=\"/page/Saving_throw\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Absolute_Law\" title=\"Absolute Law\">Absolute Law</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Absolute_Law\" title=\"Absolute Law\">Absolute Law</a>:</b> This weapon is infused with the ultimate power of Law. It does an additional 2 to 12 damage to non-lawful targets and can only be wielded by Lawful-aligned characters.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Vorpal#Vorpal\" title=\"Vorpal\">  Vorpal</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vorpal#Vorpal\" title=\"Vorpal\">  Vorpal</a>:</b> Passive: <a href=\"/page/Weapon_dice_multiplier\" title=\"Weapon dice multiplier\">+0.5[W]</a> damage dice.<br />On <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Hit</a>: If your target has fewer than 1000 Hit Points, they are instantly slain. If your target has above 1000 Hit Points, they take 100 damage.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Keen\" title=\"Keen\">Keen</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Keen\" title=\"Keen\">Keen</a>:</b> Passive: The base critical <a href=\"/page/Threat_range\" title=\"Threat range\">threat range</a> of this weapon is doubled. This does not stack with <a href=\"/page/Improved_Critical\" title=\"Improved Critical\">Improved Critical</a> feat. <a href=\"/page/Vorpal_Strike\" title=\"Vorpal Strike\">Vorpal Strikes</a> by this weapon also bypass all <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Maiming\" title=\"Maiming\">Maiming</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Maiming\" title=\"Maiming\">Maiming</a>:</b> This weapon has a twisted haft or grip and spikes along its blade, head, or point. Whenever you score a critical hit with this weapon it deals an amount of extra untyped damage depending on its critical multiplier: x2 - 1 to 6, x3 - 2 to 12, x4 - 3 to 18.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Bleed#Bleed\" title=\"Bleed\">Bleed</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Bleed#Bleed\" title=\"Bleed\">Bleed</a>:</b> This weapon is cruelly sharp and will do an additional 1 to 8 damage to targets that are vulnerable to bleeding.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Oathblade.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Oathblade.png/420px-Oathblade.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"705\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Oathblade.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>This exquisite longsword is sharper than any blade you have seen before. Engraved upon the blade are the cryptic words 'Hope rides alone.'</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816212735\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.156 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4653/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36870/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 12869/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 16/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n103.04%  138.583     62 Template:IO\n100.00%  134.492      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  134.492      1 -total\n 97.67%  131.354      1 Template:Named_Weapon\n 36.09%   48.539      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 34.89%   46.922      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 32.60%   43.842      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 31.52%   42.386      2 Template:InCategory\n 27.12%   36.474     11 Template:Popup\n 16.46%   22.135      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:24218-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816212735 and revision id 678007. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
